{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-lbyure",
  "id": "source-41001",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41001001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "不久之前——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001002",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "深夜之时，已经无人的手办店铺中响起时轻时重的脚步声。一声，两声，声音来到隔壁的走廊……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001003",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "三声，四声，声音在你的背后消失——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "咯咯，只有专业人士才能察觉的最新怪谈。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "一定是诞生不久的幽灵，趁着别人都没发现，这次肯定可以抓到它！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "啪嚓——轰——噼里啪啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "——！什，什么声音？难道是还有别人来抓幽灵？这可不行！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "……能……库……醒醒！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "烟雾里好像有声音？果真有幽灵？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "咳咳，初生的同胞哟，不用害怕，让我们一起——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001011",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一只苍白的手即将穿过烟雾碰上恭介的肩膀。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "唔……恭介学长？我这是……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "呼，你醒了，刚刚似乎有什么东西从外面砸进来了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "啊，恭恭恭介学长……你的背后有手……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼——！是幽灵啊——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊不是鬼啊——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41001017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "是……和我们一样大小的……人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
